<title>CANADA: Co-Steel Q3 shr net turns to loss.</title>
<headline>Co-Steel Q3 shr net turns to loss.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			 1995</p>
<p> Shr	   loss	 $0.24  profit	  $0.14</p>
<p> Net	   loss     C$7,400  profit	C$4,200</p>
<p> Revs		   C$323,000		C$327,400</p>
<p>	    9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	   loss	 $0.40  profit	  $2.14</p>
<p> Net	   loss    C$12,300  profit     C$64,900</p>
<p> Revs		 C$1,091,700	    C$1,094,800</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note:  1995 net earnings included a gain on sale of long-term investments</p>
<p>totaling C$23.5 million after tax or C$0.77 a share.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
